{"id":"n55441-1-8","stage":1,"title":"명절 · 传统节日","scene":"节日回乡探亲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55441-1-8-1","ko":"명절은 즐겁게 보내셨어요?","zh":"传统节日过得开心吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"명절은","meaning":"传统节日","explanation":"명절：春节、中秋等传统节日；은 标记话题，这里询问节日过得如何。","readings":[{"term":"명절","audio":"/audio/7626dbdf4beacffb4c81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55441","senseId":"1","lemma":"명절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"명절은","audio":"/audio/502a7b59ff2a2492d981.mp3"}},{"text":"즐겁게","meaning":"愉快地","explanation":"즐겁다：愉快；-게 把形容词变为副词，修饰“度过”。","readings":[{"term":"즐겁다","audio":"/audio/71ab7f4d89daedabda61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62101","senseId":"1","lemma":"즐겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"즐겁게","audio":"/audio/e99655b0371aabd53eb2.mp3"}},{"text":"보내셨어요?","meaning":"度过","explanation":"보내다：度过；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"7","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보내셨어요","audio":"/audio/f0107ca4a35896c0f2ba.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7626dbdf4beacffb","term":"명절","zh":"传统节日","audio":"/audio/7626dbdf4beacffb4c81.mp3","entryId":"55441","definition":"春节、中秋等每年固定庆祝的传统节日。","pronunciation":["명절"]},{"id":"71ab7f4d89daedab","term":"즐겁다","zh":"愉快，欢乐，欢快","audio":"/audio/71ab7f4d89daedabda61.mp3","entryId":"62101","definition":"内心满意、满足且快乐。","pronunciation":["즐겁따"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"度过","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"让时间流逝。","pronunciation":["보내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/80bc4392bfda6335b8e6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55441-1-8-2","ko":"네. 고향에 가서 부모님과 형제들도 만나고, 정말 즐거웠어요.","zh":"嗯，我回了老家，还见了父母和兄弟姐妹们，真的很开心。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"嗯、是的","explanation":"네：礼貌地肯定回应对方的提问。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"고향에","meaning":"故乡，家乡","explanation":"고향：故乡，家乡；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"고향","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27364","senseId":"1","lemma":"고향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고향에","audio":"/audio/a09c591b445023ab68e7.mp3"}},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가서","audio":"/audio/0a4296790d3f4b0e6e6b.mp3"}},{"text":"부모님과","meaning":"父母","explanation":"부모님：父母；과：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"부모님","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62272","senseId":"1","lemma":"부모님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부모님과","audio":"/audio/22e517ac7e4ba20e7abd.mp3"}},{"text":"형제들도","meaning":"兄弟姐妹","explanation":"형제：这里包括兄弟姐妹；-들 表示复数，-도 表示也见到了他们。","readings":[{"term":"형제","audio":"/audio/6d2b6b10fa368657dc32.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73223","senseId":"2","lemma":"형제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"형제들도","audio":"/audio/91eb58da567fdac431af.mp3"}},{"text":"만나고,","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만나고","audio":"/audio/dea8ba830b515603a2d5.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"즐거웠어요.","meaning":"愉快，欢乐，欢快","explanation":"즐겁다：愉快，欢乐，欢快；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"즐겁다","audio":"/audio/71ab7f4d89daedabda61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62101","senseId":"1","lemma":"즐겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"즐거웠어요","audio":"/audio/119a6bba38ac3398b1da.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"嗯、是的","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"礼貌地肯定回答对方的提问。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"998538467e18fc3a","term":"고향","zh":"故乡，家乡","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3","entryId":"27364","definition":"出生成长的地方。","pronunciation":["고향"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"068bccdcf866defe","term":"부모님","zh":"父母","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3","entryId":"62272","definition":"(敬语)父亲和母亲。","pronunciation":["부모님"]},{"id":"6d2b6b10fa368657","term":"형제","zh":"兄弟姐妹","audio":"/audio/6d2b6b10fa368657dc32.mp3","entryId":"73223","definition":"同父母所生或养育的子女们；此处指回乡见到的兄弟姐妹。","pronunciation":["형제"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"71ab7f4d89daedab","term":"즐겁다","zh":"愉快，欢乐，欢快","audio":"/audio/71ab7f4d89daedabda61.mp3","entryId":"62101","definition":"内心满意、满足且快乐。","pronunciation":["즐겁따"]}],"audio":"/audio/6c38ad0c19b170e3b454.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.33,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=55441","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","li